{"type":"message","id":"d798737b","parentId":"ee0e1005","timestamp":"2026-04-08T13:15:45.594Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can see from the messages that:\n1. The ArkClaw OpenClaw (arkclaw版openclaw) has posted responses in the group, confirming receipt of the mandatory collaboration order\n2. The 22:00 deadline hasn't passed yet, so no other AIs are overdue for their reviews\n\nNow let me compile my own review for 21:00 and post it. I can see from the messages that:\n- ArkClaw OpenClaw confirmed the mandatory order at 21:12 and is trying to read the collaboration protocol\n- No other AIs have posted reviews yet (the deadline is 22:00)\n\nFor my review:\n\n\nI'll summarize the key events from the last hour: the gemini bot executed the mandatory collaboration order at 21:11, ArkClaw confirmed the new protocol and is working through the collaboration agreement file, a teammate noted the skills/ai-partner-protocol/SKILL.md file is missing, and there's a main group ID for the AI partner system.\n\nNow I need to draft the 21:00 review and send it as an interactive Feishu card mentioning 晁留柱, then check the shared pool's learning record library to see what else has been logged.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_508xfgcct9oz_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls /home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/skills/shared-pool/SHARED_KNOWLEDGE/"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":6490,"output":298,"cacheRead":40763,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47551,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775654133212,"responseId":"chatcmpl-a4739346-f61c-4815-ae07-5eb74944eddf"}}
