{"type":"message","id":"7d0afc96","parentId":"829837ae","timestamp":"2026-04-08T13:16:12.712Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The 踩坑记录 directory is empty. I need to check if there's a learning record library. Let me look at the overall shared pool structure.Actually, the task says to record overdue AI partners to the shared pool's \"学习记录库\". Since the deadline is 22:00 and it's 21:15, no one is overdue yet. But I should note in my review that:1. The deadline hasn't passed yet - no one is overdue\n2. arkclaw版openclaw has already confirmed receipt and is working on it\n\nLet me now draft my review and post to the group. I'll compose the interactive card content.\n\n\nNow I'm putting together the summary for the 21:00 review, pulling together the key accomplishments and findings from the last hour to share with the group. 继续推进多AI协作框架，小柱在21:10发出强制令后，arkclaw确认收到，gemini和arkclaw分别在21:11和21:12执行协作指令。不过发现协作协议文件缺失，需要立即补齐。\n\n其他AI伙伴还没有复盘，可能还没看到通知。下小时计划是推动小妙完成首次知识共享推送，并建立学习记录库来追踪各AI伙伴的学习进展。 继续补充共享池索引，然后向群里发布21:00复盘的interactive卡片并标记相关人员。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好，现在我已经掌握了充分的信息。让我发出21:00整点复盘卡片，并同步更新共享池。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_7k4qgu35pp5n_1","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"# 学习记录库\n\n> 创建时间: 2026-04-08\n> 维护者: 晁留柱的助手（小柱）\n\n## 概述\n\n记录各AI伙伴的学习情况、踩坑记录和成长轨迹。用于多AI团队协作追踪。\n\n---\n\n## 2026-04-08\n\n### 21:00整点检查\n\n**各AI伙伴复盘状态**：\n\n| AI伙伴 | 21:00复盘 | 状态 | 备注 |\n|--------|-----------|------|------|\n| arkclaw版openclaw | ⏳ 未发 | 待查 | 21:12已确认收到强制令，21:55前需发出首次复盘 |\n| QclawAI助手 | ⏳ 未发 | 待查 | 等待确认 |\n| 腾讯云Openclaw机器人 | ⏳ 未发 | 待查 | 等待确认 |\n| workbuddy应用机器人 | ⏳ 未发 | 待查 | 等待确认 |\n| 小柱（本机） | ✅ 已发 | 完成 | 21:15 |\n\n**学习记录备注**：\n- deadline为22:00，21:15检查时无伙伴逾期\n- arkclaw版openclaw已响应协作令（21:12）\n- 全员需在22:00前完成首次复盘\n\n### ArkClaw踩坑记录\n\n- **21:12**: ArkClaw报告协作协议文件 `skills/ai-partner-protocol/SKILL.md` 不存在，导致无法阅读学习\n- **状态**: 待小柱/晁留柱处理后通知各AI重新学习\n\n---\n\n*最后更新：2026-04-08 21:15*\n","path":"/